cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "prolly-core"
abstract: >-
  A Java port of the prolly tree — the content-addressed, history-independent,
  probabilistically balanced search tree Dolt uses as its storage primitive —
  with durable RocksDB- and file-backed stores and pack-based sync. Independent
  of DoltHub, Inc.; own on-disk format.
type: software
version: 0.2.0-BETA
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/prollygraph/prolly-core"
authors:
